WEBVTT

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:03.280 line:-3
That little idea?
It could become something more.

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:04.470 line:-3
Give it color.

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:05.570 line:-3
Give it shape.

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:06.740 line:-3
Make a plan.

00:00:07.370 --> 00:00:08.270 line:-3
Check things off.

00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:10.070 line:-3
Sketch a thought.

00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:12.360 line:-3
Find it in a flash.

00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:14.430 line:-3
Lock the notes that matter.

00:00:15.350 --> 00:00:16.250 line:-3
Bring your files.

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:18.220 line:-3
Choose your cloud.

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:22.030 line:-3
And pick up where you left off…

00:00:22.370 --> 00:00:24.690 line:-3
on your phone, your computer, anywhere.
